    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please Smile!</strong>\u00a0<strong>A 3D platformer optimized for mouse and keyboard!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>100% Gameplay!</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience 60 increasingly challenging rooms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No language barriers, no cutscenes, no interruptions!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Exciting Abilities!</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop or reverse time!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/206403d5109fa856f22a38853c28ee36.poster.avif?t=1734007004\" width=450 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/206403d5109fa856f22a38853c28ee36.webm?t=1734007004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/206403d5109fa856f22a38853c28ee36.mp4?t=1734007004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch platformer areas between two states!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/8eba9e4e35b370ee2f288fffbbe6e48b.poster.avif?t=1734007004\" width=450 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/8eba9e4e35b370ee2f288fffbbe6e48b.webm?t=1734007004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/8eba9e4e35b370ee2f288fffbbe6e48b.mp4?t=1734007004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the dash to reach even distant platforms!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/0173cd0d6422cd2453f18d57138ef8ad.poster.avif?t=1734007004\" width=450 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/0173cd0d6422cd2453f18d57138ef8ad.webm?t=1734007004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/0173cd0d6422cd2453f18d57138ef8ad.mp4?t=1734007004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redirect gravity to new objects!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/f67cb929e6d2363cab6a064aa8493c3f.poster.avif?t=1734007004\" width=450 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/f67cb929e6d2363cab6a064aa8493c3f.webm?t=1734007004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/f67cb929e6d2363cab6a064aa8493c3f.mp4?t=1734007004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot targets to change the world from afar!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/644afde500b252af1345e5689121fa02.avif?t=1734007004\" width=600 height=330 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>No Enemies, Full Variety!</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never get bored even without enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room embodies its own idea! From invisible platforms to creative sets with secrets!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/d756c8bef6466e5a203b8177129d65d9.poster.avif?t=1734007004\" width=450 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/d756c8bef6466e5a203b8177129d65d9.webm?t=1734007004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106620/extras/d756c8bef6466e5a203b8177129d65d9.mp4?t=1734007004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
